Tessera V1 purpose preamble (profile tessera-v1-strict). This bundle is a Tessera V1 receipt. A VALID_STRICT result means: these exact content bytes were presented to the Tessera V1 service for wamason.com before the selected Bitcoin block was mined. That block's header time T is not a UTC upper bound. The receipt attests no submitter, no meaning of the content, no revocation status and no standing, and it does not check any signature inside the content. To check the receipt, use the specification and conformance vectors carried in this bundle and the external standards named in its dependency manifest.
